 "391a10ae0": {
  "gloss": "happy",
  "tier": "B",
  "n": 4,
  "evidence": "one glyph from K&T's 390a10ae0 'happy', and all four occurrences stand immediately before their virgin Mary, which is where the book says 'happy virgin Mary' over and over (138v:2, 139r:1, 139r:3). 146v:9, 147v:5, 147v:6 and 148r:2 are the close of the miracle of the image. The formula is the check; K&T do not cite these lines"
